sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as useChat
    participant S as sessionStorage
    participant W as WebSocket
    participant B as backend

    U->>S: loadResumeToken()
    U->>W: new WebSocket(url, protocols)
    Note over U,W: kbb.v1 alone, or kbb.v1 plus<br/>kbb.resume.TOKEN when one exists
    W->>B: handshake
    B-->>W: connected {limits, features, resumeToken, resumed?}
    U->>S: saveResumeToken(new one)
    U->>U: dispatch every frame through toAction

    Note over W: socket closes
    U->>U: everOpened? if not, suppress the toast
    U->>B: probeCapacity() — ONCE, on failure only
    U->>U: wait backoff[attempt] with jitter, then reconnect
